    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OakRidge Research</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game inspired by SCP lore, set in a small, inexperienced research facility. You take on the role of a junior night-shift researcher tasked with routine data analysis\u2014but things quickly spiral into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Task-Based Progression:</strong> Use an in-game computer to complete data entry and decoding tasks that slowly unravel the facility's dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Elements:</strong> Experience a creeping sense of dread through subtle environmental storytelling, distorted audio logs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth:</strong> Piece together logs, voice recordings, and environmental clues to understand what the research team was studying\u2014and why it went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disturbing Themes:</strong> The game contains depictions of suicide, blood, corpses, and intense psychological horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is meant to be played in one sitting taking around 20-25 minutes to complete</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OakRidge Research</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game inspired by SCP lore, set in a small, inexperienced research facility. You take on the role of a junior night-shift researcher tasked with routine data analysis\u2014but things quickly spiral into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Task-Based Progression:</strong> Use an in-game computer to complete data entry and decoding tasks that slowly unravel the facility's dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Elements:</strong> Experience a creeping sense of dread through subtle environmental storytelling, distorted audio logs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth:</strong> Piece together logs, voice recordings, and environmental clues to understand what the research team was studying\u2014and why it went wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disturbing Themes:</strong> The game contains depictions of suicide, blood, corpses, and intense psychological horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is meant to be played in one sitting taking around 20-25 minutes to complete</p>",
